This directory is a vendored, unmodified copy of the header-only
Random123 library (counter-based random number generators) from

  https://github.com/DEShawResearch/random123

pinned to release tag v1.14.0 (the include/Random123 subtree).

Random123 is BSD-3-Clause licensed; see the LICENSE file in this
directory.

DO NOT EDIT these headers locally.  To update, re-fetch the
include/Random123 subtree from a newer Random123 release tag and replace
this directory wholesale, keeping this note and the LICENSE.

It is vendored here (rather than taken as an external) because it is
header-only and is only used internally by Root/Philox4x32RNGTestTool.cxx
for preliminary RNG performance studies.
